# SEO and Core Web Vitals

## Principle
Optimize for search engines and user experience metrics.

## Guidelines
- Use semantic HTML: header, main, nav, footer
- Generate dynamic sitemaps and robots.txt
- Set proper meta tags: title, description, og, twitter
- Ensure LCP < 2.5s, INP < 200ms, CLS < 0.1
- Preload critical fonts and resources

## Astro Specific
```astro
---
export const prerender = true;
---
```

Use `ViewTransitions` for smooth navigation without hurting CLS.

## Monitoring
Track Web Vitals with web-vitals library in production.
